OL,3,CPlans to reinstall popular attraction
OL,4,Con seafront to be discussed by council
OL,6,FA decision is set to be made on the
OL,7,Fpossible return of the Brighton Wheel
OL,8,Fto the city's seafront.
OL,10,FThe popular tourist attraction - which
OL,11,Fwas originally installed in 2011 - was
OL,12,Fdismantled in 2016, after its lease
OL,13,Fexpired, and to make way for the
OL,14,Fdevelopment of the i360.
OL,16,FBut a local business has now
OL,17,Fapproached Brighton & Hove City
OL,18,FCouncil with a proposal to start
OL,19,Foperating the wheel again as part of a
OL,20,F25-year lease.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G1/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
