OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1787041089
OL,3,CPlans to reinstall popular attraction
OL,4,Con seafront to be discussed by council
OL,6,FThe council will discuss the plans at
OL,7,Fa meeting in September.
OL,9,FThe firm - which already operates the
OL,10,FBrighton Zip & Daltons Venue - plans
OL,11,Fto re-install the wheel on its
OL,12,Foriginal site on Madeira Drive.
OL,14,FIt's confirmed that the zip wire will
OL,15,Fremain, if the proposals are approved.
OL,17,FUnder the proposed new lease, the
OL,18,Foperator would be fully responsible
OL,19,Ffor all operational costs, staffing,
OL,20,Fmaintenance, business performance and
OL,21,Fday-to-day trading activity.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G2/5
OL,2,W,.!" ,.!+, "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext PageBS-SE Eng NewsCThis DayFReg TV
