OL,3,CPlans to reinstall popular attraction
OL,4,Con seafront to be discussed by council
OL,6,FAs a result, the council would receive
OL,7,Fa guaranteed commercial rent for the
OL,8,Fduration of the lease, providing a
OL,9,Fdirect financial benefit from the
OL,10,Fattraction.
OL,12,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,13,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,14,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,15,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,17,FThe authority said any income would be
OL,18,Fused to "support the ongoing efforts
OL,19,Fto maintain and enhance all that is
OL,20,Fgreat about Brighton & Hove".
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G3/5
