PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F382A1787041089
OL,3,CPlans to reinstall popular attraction
OL,4,Con seafront to be discussed by council
OL,6,FIf approved at Cabinet, the operator
OL,7,Fwill seek planning permission and aim
OL,8,Fto have the wheel up and running by
OL,9,Fnext summer.
OL,11,FBrighton & Hove City Councillor David
OL,12,FMcGregor said the potential return of
OL,13,Fthe wheel would "bring new energy to
OL,14,Fthe east of the city".
OL,16,FHe said: "Brighton became Brighton
OL,17,Fbecause people came here to have fun
OL,18,Fby the sea.
OL,1,W~s1x0~s1~s hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}   G4/5
